            <ArticleTitle>Kawasaki disease.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>125-7</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Kawasaki disease is currently the leading cause of acquired heart disease in children in the United States and Japan. The case of an 18-year-old insurance applicant is used to review the pathogenesis, complications, treatment and prognostic implications of this disorder.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
